<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23203" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιδάλλω</span></b> , 
			Act.
		 only in pres. and
			impf.:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>work cunningly, embellish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάκος . . πάντοσε δαιδάλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.479
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέχος ἔξεον . . δαιδάλλων χρυσῷ τε
					καὶ ἀργύρῳ ἠδ᾽ ἐλέφαντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					23.200
				</span></i>
			; of a <i>painter</i> or <i>sculptor,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.335
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.967
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, to be <i>spotted, marked,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφραγῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					1.324
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πόλιν εὐανορίαισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					5.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἔπεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Parth.</u>
					2.32
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδαιδαλμένοι ψεύδεσι μῦθοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>O.</u>
					1.29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῦτος ἀρεταῖς δεδ.</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.53
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[μέλη] δαιδαλθέντ᾽ ἀοιδαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>N.</u>
					11.18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
